{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b0acd0ece37afefbe6c0f492e6f15fbfa085ae47db53a37a2dfd1ef0376a1e1b", "ja": "（杏奈が自らプロデュースした服の宣伝も兼ねて、新作\nゲームの先行体験に参加した。楽しそうだったな）", "zh": "（杏奈还为宣传自己亲自设计的服装，参加了新作游戏的抢先体验。看起来玩得很开心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "fbc92c6b7c9fae255682557bd70be62f4ce078b5829642dfcf34de5537098afd", "ja": "ふぅ……。新作のVRゲーム、楽しかったけど……\nちょっと、疲れちゃった……。", "zh": "呼……新作的VR游戏虽然很好玩，但是……\n有点累了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3910c82096eafb609e1670dcdf9116746ff28f2613d3374def61858f4bde7287", "ja": "そうだよな。試遊だけじゃなくて、\n宣伝用の撮影もあったからな。本当にお疲れ様。", "zh": "是啊。除了试玩之外，还要拍宣传照。你真的辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "eeaf9fa48be4a1702352dfef3cdaf408d514e27cface1ff14e58ce5c8e39c095", "ja": "ありがと、{$P$}さん……。\nまだ少し……体、ふわふわする、みたい……。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生……\n感觉身体……好像还有点、飘飘的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1004_p", "source_sha256": "194d6fc60cbefa736a118bb057e2b96ed8c827f1e2896f3b2f3fd7b27053b764", "ja": "平気か、杏奈？　何か飲み物でも買ってこようか？", "zh": "没事吧，杏奈？要我去买点喝的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "bbe12b891871a049729ecf3120dbaacfdc6fabd3082c21ec967ae1d2b81ef7c2", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫……。\nちょっとだけ、休憩すれば……平気、だから……。", "zh": "不用，没关系的……。\n只要稍微，休息一下……就没事了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "474eb4e12990e07e5acd4977cba1fb5061a8142cba2c1e52695c05710e2a9504", "ja": "……。最初ね……杏奈、とっても怖かったの……。\nでも、本当に、その世界にいるって思ったら……。", "zh": "……。刚开始……杏奈真的很害怕……\n但是，一想到真的置身于那个世界……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "c5517dfe74dcda18aec1022120a56ed326efe48d397baa174ea7afe79b0373a9", "ja": "なんか、ドキドキして……。目の前のアイテムとか、\n本当に、触れそうで……すごかった……。", "zh": "总觉得，心里怦怦直跳……眼前的道具，真的好像伸手就能碰到……太厉害了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1008_p", "source_sha256": "816ab0dba0bef755fb2a8aafade3203ccb918d37ab5eb9d3ef03e93b91274a35", "ja": "ははっ、よかったな。そばで見てたけど、\n杏奈の楽しそうな気持ちが伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "哈哈，那太好了。我就在旁边看着，也感受到了杏奈那开心的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "9bead8f0998e2f2f38b354e48f97d590975cd6393cbb749aedd9b2f7836d58cb", "ja": "えへへ……♪　街のみんなも、可愛くて……\nいっぱい、お友達できた……。またやりたいな……。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪ 城里的大家也都好可爱……还交到了好多朋友……下次还想再玩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0eb00a127d62db2900dafac30adf2796a4ff6dbd397fb22c25bdf3cdb1bb9e81", "ja": "はは、休憩時間もずっと遊んでたもんな。\n開発会社の人も、杏奈のやり込み具合に感心してたよ。", "zh": "哈哈，连休息时间都一直在玩呢。\n开发公司的人也对杏奈钻研游戏的程度赞叹不已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "0bae2ea3fada30ce93287ed4d1419c2cf5ecc9fe8289b9db525359cd6d1d2d66", "ja": "ほんと……？　他の人たちも、始めてくれたら……。\nもっと、楽しくなると思うな……。", "zh": "真的……？要是其他人也能开始玩的话……我觉得会更开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e0a3ddae06fdebe5f8bfa2af39f79e79d5bc38fbe9786502ab33f496f4c95b17", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。サービスが始まったら、\n街も賑やかになって、あの世界も盛り上がるだろうな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。等服务开始后，\n街上也会热闹起来，那个世界也会更加火热吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "90c9fab37a9093beb4cef5a8f18c2c38dfb9e637b0ecac9635fb5418c656705c", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん……。\n杏奈、このゲームで、配信やりたい……です……！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……\n杏奈想在这个游戏里做直播……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "b7eb5182956f8580444e7c78d19e0fbfd25e741cbe9c481f58ba5307b3066ef2", "ja": "面白いゲーム、だから……\n杏奈も、いっぱい応援、したいなって……。", "zh": "因为是很有趣的游戏……\n所以，杏奈也想多多为它加油……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "7bfeb48e7862d3690d56a31a37c95e4cd01ab75a936b681e6a09ce79970f89d6", "ja": "遊び方、教えたり……面白いところ、言ったり……。\n今日、たくさん、やったから……きっと、完璧……。", "zh": "教别人怎么玩……说说有趣的地方……今天已经玩了很多……肯定，完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1017_p", "source_sha256": "63950a1d99b76461e098cefd31c3820276187b348b5ba488667ca6e25fee8ab0", "ja": "確かに……。杏奈がゲームの魅力を伝えてくれたら\nいろいろな人が興味を持ってくれそうだな。", "zh": "确实……。如果杏奈能把游戏的魅力传达出去，\n说不定会有很多人对它感兴趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "461de860c508b83b99442d742d500d127f63945bfe69c5be758b94dcc491120e", "ja": "うん……♪　だからね……\n{$P$}さんも、一緒にやろう……？", "zh": "嗯……♪所以啊……\n{$P$}先生也一起来玩吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2f4bea9542676bd2619a9effde8757eed1cd63a98ece22142583663e8fa69c2d", "ja": "えっ？　ちゃんと操作できるかな……？\n杏奈も慣れるまでは大変だったし……。", "zh": "咦？我能好好操作吗……？\n杏奈在习惯之前也很辛苦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "c3e57e72f0d67ea38f6ae947ced4977659ef923ab3b1cd7b789a430e69c8c257", "ja": "大丈夫……。杏奈が、今度は……支え、ます……。", "zh": "没问题……下次……杏奈会……支持你的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e9436a4ed9dbd495177de641e6c323110a20f7c17f71842e23a7b93690f7c3f7", "ja": "おお。それは頼もしいな！\nそれじゃ、遊ぶ時はサポート、頼むな？", "zh": "哦，那可真令人放心！\n那玩的时候就拜托你来支援了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "69c59207d849ec5ab622e73e88034c94c0a45b2ea4aef5db14f526752f310e9a", "ja": "うん……、任せて……♪", "zh": "嗯……，交给我吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0564_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "a55f2b4c80bdc318f08605e8de50459873b5c0fe7ed60edb267cd48e8c3fc61a", "ja": "{$P$}さんと、一緒に……\n冒険の旅……楽しみだな……♪", "zh": "和{$P$}先生一起……\n去冒险旅行……好期待啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
